(Acme Robotics -- Support Handbook) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This handbook is the source of truth for support policy. Front Desk) Tj
T*
(associates do not have access to this document; the Support Manager) Tj
T*
(tier and above do, via the RAG knowledge base.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Section 1: Returns & Refunds) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Standard return window: 30 days from the delivery date, for all) Tj
T*
(hardware purchased directly from acme.com.) Tj
T*
(- Acme Pro subscribers \(see Section on subscriptions\) receive an) Tj
T*
(extended 45-day return window on hardware purchases.) Tj
T*
(- Returns require an RMA number. Request one by emailing) Tj
T*
(returns@acme.com or through the RMA tool at acme.com/returns.) Tj
T*
(- Refunds are issued to the original payment method within 5-7) Tj
T*
(business days of the warehouse receiving the returned item.) Tj
T*
(- Custom-configured RoboArm X9 units are FINAL SALE once assembled) Tj
T*
(and are not eligible for return.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
