72 720 Td
(Section 2: Warranty Coverage) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- All Acme Robotics hardware ships with a 2-year limited warranty) Tj
T*
(covering manufacturing defects.) Tj
T*
(- The RoboArm X9 and RoboArm X9 Pro extend to a 3-year warranty) Tj
T*
(when registered within 30 days of purchase at acme.com/register.) Tj
T*
(- Warranty claims require a claim code in the format ARW-#####) Tj
T*
(\(five digits\). Claim codes are issued after a diagnostic call) Tj
T*
(with support -- customers cannot self-issue one.) Tj
T*
(- Water damage, drops, and unauthorized firmware modifications) Tj
T*
(void the warranty immediately.) Tj
T*
(- Battery packs are covered for 1 year only, regardless of the) Tj
T*
(hardware's warranty term.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
