72 720 Td
(Section 3: Hardware Troubleshooting Codes) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Error E-101 \(Motor calibration failure\): hold the RESET button) Tj
T*
(for 10 seconds until the LED blinks blue, then re-run calibration) Tj
T*
(from the companion app. Front Desk and Manager can both walk a) Tj
T*
(customer through this.) Tj
T*
(- Error E-204 \(Battery communication fault\): reseat the battery) Tj
T*
(pack. If the code persists after 3 attempts, the battery) Tj
T*
(requires replacement under warranty.) Tj
T*
(- Error E-317 \(Firmware checksum mismatch\): reflash firmware via) Tj
T*
(USB-C using the Acme Recovery Tool. Do not attempt this over) Tj
T*
(Wi-Fi -- an interrupted OTA update is what causes this error in) Tj
T*
(the first place.) Tj
T*
(- Error E-450 \(Joint overcurrent protection tripped\): power cycle) Tj
T*
(the unit. If it recurs within 24 hours, stop use and contact) Tj
T*
(support -- this can indicate a mechanical obstruction.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
