72 720 Td
(Section 4: When to Escalate) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Front Desk associates handle order status, general policy) Tj
T*
(questions, and basic troubleshooting \(E-101, E-204\).) Tj
T*
(- Support Managers have access to the order and RMA systems and) Tj
T*
(additionally handle E-317 and E-450 codes, plus policy) Tj
T*
(exceptions up to $200.) Tj
T*
(- The VP of Customer Success can authorize policy exceptions) Tj
T*
(above $200, coordinate with engineering on recurring hardware) Tj
T*
(faults, and search the live web for parts availability and) Tj
T*
(compatibility questions.) Tj
T*
(- Escalations reaching the CEO's office are reserved for cases) Tj
T*
(requiring executive judgment, PR-sensitive situations, or a) Tj
T*
(problem that has already failed to resolve at every lower tier.) Tj
ET
endstream
